    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1728">

                <pb facs="1399" n="1283" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1283"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.124/11.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 25, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The proposition of Acting Assistant Surgeon Converse has been accepted by the
                    President. Papers will await him at Iquitos; it is desired that he proceed at
                    once, via Amazon. Any remaining time after completion of Iquitos work will be
                    employed elsewhere.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Howard.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
